---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// ── LEGAL TEXT — REVIEW BEFORE RELYING ON IT ────────────────────────────────
// GDPR Art. 13 privacy notice. Reflects the site AS BUILT: static hosting on
// Vercel, self-hosted fonts, NO cookies, NO analytics, NO contact form.
// If/when analytics or other processing is added (e.g. v0.3.0 Phase B), this
// MUST be updated. Verify Vercel's company address + transfer mechanism, and
// consider a German-language version. Not a substitute for legal advice.
// Reachable on the placeholder too (NOT gated by COMING_SOON).
// ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
const updated = '21 June 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy — Robert Kiss" description="Privacy policy for kissrobert.com.">
  <section class="section container">
    <div class="prose">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← back</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>1. Controller</h2>
      <p>
        The controller responsible for data processing on this website within the
        meaning of the GDPR is:
      </p>
      <p>
        Robert Madocsa Kiss<br />
        Dettelbacher Weg 19<br />
        13189 Berlin, Germany<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:kiro2160@gmail.com">kiro2160@gmail.com</a>
      </p>

      <h2>2. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        This is a static informational website. It sets <strong>no cookies</strong>,
        uses <strong>no analytics or tracking</strong>, and contains no contact
        form. The only personal data processed is what your browser necessarily
        transmits to the hosting provider in order to deliver the site, plus any
        email you choose to send.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Hosting &amp; server logs</h2>
      <p>
        The site is hosted by <strong>Vercel Inc.</strong> (340 S Lemon Ave
        #4133, Walnut, CA 91789, USA). When you access the site, Vercel
        automatically processes server log data that your browser transmits,
        including your IP address, date and time of the request, the requested
        URL, the referrer URL, and your browser/operating-system user agent.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Purpose &amp; legal basis:</strong> delivering the website
        securely and reliably and defending against attacks, based on my
        legitimate interest pursuant to Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR. A data processing
        agreement pursuant to Art. 28 GDPR is in place with Vercel. As Vercel is
        based in the USA, data may be transferred there; this transfer is
        safeguarded by the EU Standard Contractual Clauses and/or the EU–US Data
        Privacy Framework.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Fonts</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts are <strong>self-hosted</strong> and served from this site's own
        domain. No font data is requested from, or transmitted to, any
        third-party provider (such as Google Fonts).
      </p>

      <h2>5. Cookies, analytics &amp; tracking</h2>
      <p>None. This site sets no cookies and uses no analytics or tracking technologies.</p>

      <h2>6. Contact by email</h2>
      <p>
        If you email me, the data you provide (your email address and the content
        of your message) is processed solely to handle your enquiry, based on my
        legitimate interest in responding pursuant to Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR. This
        data is not passed on to third parties and is deleted once it is no longer
        required.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>access your personal data (Art. 15);</li>
        <li>rectification (Art. 16);</li>
        <li>erasure (Art. 17);</li>
        <li>restriction of processing (Art. 18);</li>
        <li>data portability (Art. 20);</li>
        <li>object to processing (Art. 21).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory
        authority. The authority responsible for the controller is the
        <a href="https://www.datenschutz-berlin.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Berlin Commissioner for Data Protection and Freedom of Information
          (Berliner Beauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit)</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        As the site evolves, this policy may be updated to reflect new processing
        activities. The “last updated” date above always reflects the current
        version.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
